{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Mantlet isn\u2019t for the faint-hearted</strong>. It\u2019s a bite-sized colossal battle, where building a massive swarm is child\u2019s play\u2014but turning them into upgraded, orbital-dropped tanks is where the real brainwork begins. And if you\u2019ve got the guts and the math skills you swore you\u2019d never need, you\u2019ll fuse those beasts into the towering Mantlet mech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t even think about doing it in peace. This is bullet hell turned up to eleven\u2014chaos raining nonstop, screens flooding with fire. If you blink, you\u2019re toast. If you hesitate, you\u2019re history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/bf30986b9ba44d1bacf318975c8f6105.avif?t=1757662742\" width=1486 height=683 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[URGENT] Mantlet One needs a commander. Proxima-B is falling.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a peaceful colonization and mining operation has escalated into a full-scale planetary conflict. A hostile response from the native inhabitants has turned Proxima-B into a war zone. Outposts are being wiped out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/44806a4e75e0f6541b631a97e02973aa.avif?t=1757662742\" width=1565 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication lines are severed. Resistance is fierce and unrelenting. You are the Fleet Commander of Mantlet One, the last major mobile command platform in orbit. Your orders are clear, establish control on the surface, deploy infantry and mechanized units to critical locations, Crush resistance and secure assets vital to New Terra\u2019s expansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/0b4d97cd3ec2ebb3ba178b7e4b95ffe5.avif?t=1757662742\" width=1486 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no longer a scientific expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is war. Start the campaign. Restore order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For New Terra.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891310?t=1757662742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/1727c9927bb2ac02bff484e6a07cd9ce76709ee5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757662742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/df1723dcd5a635f8f0b485c6bbd5b4b18c077e9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757662742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/df1723dcd5a635f8f0b485c6bbd5b4b18c077e9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757662742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent sci-fi combat violence, including blood effects, persistent corpses, and environmental bloodstains. There is no depiction of dismemberment, mutilation, or sexual content. Some characters may make mild references to medical drug use (e.g., painkillers)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Mantlet isn\u2019t for the faint-hearted</strong>. It\u2019s a bite-sized colossal battle, where building a massive swarm is child\u2019s play\u2014but turning them into upgraded, orbital-dropped tanks is where the real brainwork begins. And if you\u2019ve got the guts and the math skills you swore you\u2019d never need, you\u2019ll fuse those beasts into the towering Mantlet mech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t even think about doing it in peace. This is bullet hell turned up to eleven\u2014chaos raining nonstop, screens flooding with fire. If you blink, you\u2019re toast. If you hesitate, you\u2019re history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/bf30986b9ba44d1bacf318975c8f6105.avif?t=1757662742\" width=1486 height=683 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[URGENT] Mantlet One needs a commander. Proxima-B is falling.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a peaceful colonization and mining operation has escalated into a full-scale planetary conflict. A hostile response from the native inhabitants has turned Proxima-B into a war zone. Outposts are being wiped out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/44806a4e75e0f6541b631a97e02973aa.avif?t=1757662742\" width=1565 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication lines are severed. Resistance is fierce and unrelenting. You are the Fleet Commander of Mantlet One, the last major mobile command platform in orbit. Your orders are clear, establish control on the surface, deploy infantry and mechanized units to critical locations, Crush resistance and secure assets vital to New Terra\u2019s expansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/extras/0b4d97cd3ec2ebb3ba178b7e4b95ffe5.avif?t=1757662742\" width=1486 height=682 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no longer a scientific expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is war. Start the campaign. Restore order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For New Terra.</p>","developers":["game_gland"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891310/b2467fbb4eeed4611a3f9e2a88740e7d9a1b183c/header.jpg?t=1757662742","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0 (Deck)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan-compatible GPU (NVIDIA 1050 / AMD RX 560 / Intel Arc)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0 (Deck)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 / AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 1660 Ti / AMD RX 580 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192248,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192248/movie480.mp4?t=1757662737","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192248/movie_max.mp4?t=1757662737"},"name":"latest gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192248/82757b72b8b07c7488d32a7aae707e9da64ced8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757662737","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192248/movie480_vp9.webm?t=17576627